Matias

Pleased to hear your results are now sensible.  Distance performs its estimation of animal density.  The only use made of study area size is to multiply at the final step to convert density to abundance.  The coefficient of variation of abundance is the same as the coefficient of variation of density because the multiplier (area) is a constant.

Your messages should provide other users who visit the Google groups email list to closely check that their study area size is recorded correctly.

